l Freek", "keywords": ["Reflex", "Speed", "Buttons", "Challenge", "Time"], "long_description": "**Welcome to HI-CORP, Employee.**\n\nYou have been assigned to a control cabin. In front of you: a panel of levers, switches, buttons and cranks. Every control is real. Every control answers back \u2014 in sound, light and touch.\n\nYour job is simple: run the machine as fast as humanly possible.\n\n# Your responsibilities\n\n- Complete the production sequence. Then again. Faster.\n- Beat the clock. Beat your friends. Beat Employee #4471.\n- Climb the **Employee of the Month** leaderboard \u2014 it's global, and everyone can see your name.\n\n# A note from Management\n\nPerformance is monitored. Satisfaction is mandatory. Fun is guaranteed.\n\nTell us how your shift went \u2014 or file a complaint with HR \u2014 on Discord: https://discord.gg/4Zw3jA2T9p\n\nPush some buttons. Leave a review. HI-CORP is watching your times.\n", "short_description": "Push. Flick. Slam. Repeat. Your shift starts now."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fono-labs.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/control_freek_privacy_policy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FonoLabs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fono-labs.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_mode